2. In this Order —
“dispatch instruction” means a dispatch instruction issued under section 9.1.3 of Chapter 5 of the market rules that —
(a)relates to a specified open cycle gas turbine or specified steam plant; and
(b)requires the specified open cycle gas turbine or specified steam plant (as the case may be) to be operated at a loading level that is equal to or exceeds the loading level specified in the dispatch instruction;
“Energy Market Authority of Singapore” means the Energy Market Authority of Singapore established under the Energy Market Authority of Singapore Act 2001;
“market rules” has the meaning given by section 2(1) of the Electricity Act 2001;
“specified open cycle gas turbine” means any of the following open cycle gas turbines located at 16 Jurong Pier Road, Singapore 619175:
(a)the open cycle gas turbine with the identification number JUR GT1;
(b)the open cycle gas turbine with the identification number JUR GT2;
“specified period” means the period from 21 July 2023 to 31 December 2025 (both dates inclusive);
“specified steam plant” means any of the following steam plants located at 3 Seraya Avenue, Singapore 628209:
(a)the steam plant with the identification number SER G2;
(b)the steam plant with the identification number SER G3.
